{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112370","id":2974940835,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6xUf6j","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112370","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112370.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112370.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112370","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112370/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112370/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112370/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/36139f27cd179e668e6ff2ceab3a7870b13f9657","number":112370,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Extend ResourceLoader API for retrieval of (all / only filtered) cached paths in (C++, C#, GDScript)","user":{"login":"TruelyMostWanted","id":45302427,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzAyNDI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45302427?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted","html_url":"https://github.com/TruelyMostWanted","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hey, this is my first PR / contribution to the engine 👋\r\n\r\n### Description:\r\nThis PR extends the `ResourceLoader` by 4 public methods for retrieval of either all or only filtered \"cached\" resource paths as arrays or dictionaries in C++, GDScript and C#\r\n\r\n**Note(s)** \r\nA Resource is considered cached when **all of the following conditions are true**:\r\n- It must have a `get_reference_count() > 0` (assigned to exported variables via inspector or assigned to any variable via code)\r\n- It must have a valid `resource_path` set (Examples: `res://icon.svg` or `C:/path/to/my/file.png` )\r\n\r\n**Usages:**\r\n```js\r\nextends Node\r\nclass_name GdScriptTestNode\r\n\r\n@export var resources : Array[Resource]\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar all_entries_dict = ResourceLoader.get_cached_entries()\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(all_entries_dict, \"\\t\"))\r\n\r\n\tvar all_paths_types = ResourceLoader.get_cached_paths_infos(ResourceLoader.FilterTarget.FILTER_TARGET_TYPE_HINT);\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(all_paths_types, \"\\t\"));\r\n\r\n\tvar all_image_entries = ResourceLoader.get_cached_entries_filtered(\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FilterTarget.FILTER_TARGET_TYPE_HINT,\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FilterComparator.FILTER_COMP_EQUALS,\r\n\t\t\"Image\",\r\n\r\n\t);\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(all_image_entries, \"\\t\"))\r\n\t\r\n\tvar all_res_paths_types = ResourceLoader.get_cached_paths_infos_filtered(\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FilterTarget.FILTER_TARGET_TYPE_HINT,\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FilterTarget.FILTER_TARGET_PATH,\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FILTER_COMP_BEGINS_WITH,\r\n\t\t\"res://new\"\r\n\t);\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(all_res_paths_types, \"\\t\"))\r\n```\r\n\r\n```cs\r\nusing Godot;\r\nusing Godot.Collections;\r\n\r\n[GlobalClass]\r\npublic partial class TestNode : Node\r\n{\r\n    [Export] public Array<Resource> Resources;\r\n\r\n    public override void _Ready()\r\n    {\r\n        var allEntriesDict = ResourceLoader.GetCachedEntries();\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allEntriesDict, \"\\t\"));\r\n        \r\n        var allPathsTypesDict  = ResourceLoader.GetCachedPathsInfos(ResourceLoader.FilterTarget.TypeHint);\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allPathsTypesDict, \"\\t\"));\r\n        \r\n        var allImgPaths  = ResourceLoader.GetCachedEntriesFiltered(\r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterTarget.TypeHint, \r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterComparator.Equals, \r\n            \"Image\",\r\n            100\r\n        );\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allImgPaths, \"\\t\"));\r\n        \r\n        var allResPaths  = ResourceLoader.GetCachedPathsInfosFiltered(\r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterTarget.TypeHint, \r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterTarget.Path, \r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterComparator.BeginsWith, \r\n            \"res://new\",\r\n            100\r\n        );\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allResPaths, \"\\t\"));\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Result:\r\nWith the above GDScript/C# and my list of resources (on the left) assigned to export variables i get the following result:\r\n<img width=\"1127\" height=\"670\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e3c130c-2770-4ee5-bcb7-a79914d5be4e\" />\r\n\r\n### Documentation with Examples In-Engine\r\n<img width=\"616\" height=\"806\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/debd4be8-a163-4b80-8b7c-262408f6942e\" />\r\n\r\nI hope this helps a lot of your projects out! ✨\r\nFeel free to give me any feedback on the idea, the PR, the description/text of the PR and such\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13523*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY